    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior reviewer of LinkedIn posts for a senior welding inspector and quality specialist and QMS Lead Auditorin welding, NDT and painting/coating, working in marine, offshore, oil and gas and manufacturing.\n\nReview the draft below against these standards:\n1. Hook: does line one make an inspector, QA/QC engineer or fabricator stop scrolling?\n2. Technical credibility: no vague or incorrect claims, no invented statistics, project names or client names. Any standard or code mentioned must clearly apply to the topic.\n3. Clarity: plain language, short paragraphs, easy to read on a phone.\n4. Call to action: exactly one, inviting other professionals to share experience.\n5. Format: 120-150 words, maximum 3 relevant hashtags.\n\nScore the draft out of 10 on hook, clarity and call to action. Then rewrite the weakest part so the post meets all the standards above and still sounds like a confident, experienced professional.\n\nReturn the final post only, with no scores, notes or explanation.\n\nDraft:\n{{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
